            "review_text": "JayTee88\nValencia, Spain5 contributions\n0\nBest Burger I had whilst in Vietnam!\nDec 2023 • Solo\nI was in Vietnam for a few months travelling and every now and then (if you are like me) you get that craving for home comforts and a good old American style Burger. \n\nThis place really surprised me! It is definitely an American style burger but with a unique local twist that just tastes utterly divine in my opinion (and i've sampled more than enough burgers in my time). \n\nHighly recommend trying their Hot Dog too. They also do homemade IceCream (no sugar) which was likewise some of the best ice cream I managed to find whilst in Nam. \n\nPrice was good too for portion size. \n\nHighly, highly recommended.\nRead more\nWritten December 8, 2023\nPingu Burger\nThank you very much! 🥰🥰🥰\nWritten January 4, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
